{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20196","headline":"魏博田兴尚书听嫂命不立非夫人诗 · 孟郊","name":"魏博田兴尚书听嫂命不立非夫人诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君子躭古礼，如馋鱼吞钩。\n昨闻敬嫂言，掣心东北流。\n魏博田尚书，与礼相绸缪。\n善词闻天下，一日一再周。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20196.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20196","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}